{"content":[{"c":["WARS OF THE LORD, Book of the"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Document mentioned once in the OT (",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.14","r":"Num.21.14","rawR":"Num.21.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.14","value":"Num.21.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 21:14"},"); it is found in a description of Moab’s border at the Arnon. The book was used as a source but is no longer extant. It probably contained a record of Israel’s conquest in Transjordan and may be identical to the “Book of the Upright [Jashar]” (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.10.13","r":"Josh.10.13","rawR":"Josh.10.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.10.13","value":"Josh.10.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 10:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.1.18","r":"2Sam.1.18","rawR":"2Sam.1.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.1.18","value":"2Sam.1.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 1:18"},"). The passage in ",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.1-35","r":"Num.21.1-35","rawR":"Num.21.1-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.1-35","value":"Num.21.1-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Numbers 21"}," has a poetic style and pertains to Israel’s conquest and warfare. However, the extent of the quotation is debatable. Some limit it to verse ",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.14","r":"Num.21.14","rawR":"Num.21.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.14","value":"Num.21.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"14"},", others include verse ",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.15","r":"Num.21.15","rawR":"Num.21.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.15","value":"Num.21.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"15"},", and still others include verses ",{"href":"?bref=Num.21.27-30","r":"Num.21.27-30","rawR":"Num.21.27-30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.21.27-30","value":"Num.21.27-30"}],"t":"ref","v":"27-30"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"WarsoftheLordBookofthe","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 21:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.14","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.14","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.14"},{"anchorText":"Jos 10:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.10.13","rawQueryValue":"Josh.10.13","sourceRefExact":"Josh.10.13"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 1:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.1.18","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.1.18","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.1.18"},{"anchorText":"Numbers 21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.1-35","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.1-35","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.1-35"},{"anchorText":"14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.14","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.14","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.14"},{"anchorText":"15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.15","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.15","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.15"},{"anchorText":"27-30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.21.27-30","rawQueryValue":"Num.21.27-30","sourceRefExact":"Num.21.27-30"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"d9046e2e01abee2fd41280e91cd75f7715f138576d911d084d18102151309912","sourceItemName":"WarsoftheLordBookofthe","sourceItemOrder":9,"sourceMember":"Articles/W.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"WarsoftheLordBookofthe","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Wars of the Lord, Book of the","title":"Wars of the Lord, Book of the","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}